{ intro: 'Kwyjibo is developing into a customizable system for flashcards, to-do lists, and activity tracking. Please [help fund this project](https://gofund.me/e965a3bab "Donate on GoFundMe") by making a small donation.   Here are some example data sets to try out:  - [Esperanto Vocabulary](/k/esperanto)  - [Korean Vocabulary](/k/korean)  - [Taekwondo Transcription](/k/tkd){left}' }
